oney.py::test_half_even` failed (2.665 rounded to 2.67 instead of 2.66).\n\nChange: switch `rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP` to `rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\nCI: run ci-0001 on 08d3cd5986 passed.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-banker-rounding", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 408788, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019zRQQ7ZzG9V84P3m5vqHj9", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-banker-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 408788, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019zRQQ7ZzG9V84P3m5vqHj9", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 410834, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TdPuqvvinGM6FQT1e6JD9P", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 411134, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TdPuqvvinGM6FQT1e6JD9P", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 411134, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TdPuqvvinGM6FQT1e6JD9P", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 413154, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Cc64zz3jDwhFBB7tBgHUAE", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 413454, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Cc64zz3jDwhFBB7tBgHUAE", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": fa